      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"letting go\" sounds nice but it’s just exhausting. living like this... it feels like I'm just taking up space that someone more useful could be using. like there's no point in even trying to find a \"quiet purpose\" when the core of who I was is just gone. it's just empty.",
